{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>藝人張曦雯（Kelly）日前於社交平台分享了一輯日常靚相，展現私下率真可愛的一面！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_d2da75549e2e9cb2-490\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>相中最吸引眼球的，張曦雯身穿一襲紫色喱士吊帶睡衣的照片。素顏上陣的她肌膚透亮緊緻、狀態爆燈，大騷迷人鎖骨，女人味十足。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_d2da75549e2e9cb2-490\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"9c9104c9-6c72-4a94-941a-9409a15b1017.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026UfFXbrRBoh1789982665.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"9c9104c9-6c72-4a94-941a-9409a15b1017.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_d2da75549e2e9cb2-491\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>而另一張相片中，張曦雯又展現出女神的幽默感。見她在車上邊敷著白色紙面膜，邊戴著黑色太陽眼鏡自拍，型格又搞笑。</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_d2da75549e2e9cb2-491\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"51c099fa-4963-47ea-906a-2b0d1b9668ae.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026AQyZSo64UG1789982665.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"51c099fa-4963-47ea-906a-2b0d1b9668ae.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_d2da75549e2e9cb2-492\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>帖文吸引了一眾網民與粉絲留言狂讚：「Kelly素顏都咁靚」、「皮膚好好」、「貼地女神」、「貓貓勁cute！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-21T09:58:38.714710+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":211,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}